== Builder notes ==

'''Item feat:''' No, but it can be added with custom content.

== Custom content notes ==

'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' yes

'''Script:''' <code>nw_s2_bardsong</code>, [[spells.2da]] (411), and [[feat.2da]] (257, 355-373)

* This feat can be added to <code>[[iprp_feats.2da]]</code> to make it available as an item feat. However, since bards get this feat at level 1, there is little point in doing so unless several other changes are also made. (The [[radial menu]] option will appear only for bards unless appropriate <code>[[cls_feat_*.2da]]</code> files are changed. In addition, non-bards will get no benefits from the default script, as they will not meet the requirement of at least one bard level for the minimal benefits.)